# Docs screenshot: the Atlas Region Editor (docs/editor/atlas-region.md, #45).
wait 8
key escape
click @asset.new-scene
wait 3
click @hier.add
type atlas
click @addnode.create
wait 3
click @insp.texture
click @pick:textures/Asteroid_2.png
wait 2
click @insp.atlas.edit
wait 2
click @atlas.grid_snap
wait 1
drag @atlas.canvas+-150,-150 @atlas.canvas+100,100
wait 2
annotate @atlas.region_rect The region: drag on the image to draw it
annotate @atlas.grid_snap Snap to Grid: columns, rows or cell size
annotate @atlas.zoom Zoom (Cmd+wheel)
annotate @atlas.apply Apply to the node (one undo step)
screenshot editor_atlas-region
key f1
expect noderef.page == editor/atlas-region
